<p>I've got to say this seems like a Series I article, in that it has little narrative beyond describing the scary murder monster.</p>
<p>I think you need to try and develop some narrative:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Characters</strong></li>
<li><strong>Plot</strong> - <em>beyond the scary thing eating D-Class</em></li>
<li><strong>Themes</strong> - <em>you mention trying to capture the feeling of abandon in the thrill of a party, why not focus a bit more&#8230; instead of it just being an excuse to get people dead?</em></li>
<li><strong>An Arc</strong> - <em>what is the journey the reader goes through? Where do we start and where do we end up?</em></li>
</ul>

