<p>I think I could do that, it could be quite fun to make a trail for the foundation. And I think it would possibly be more interesting. I'm thinking first they find bodies of victims who left the party before dying, then they begin connecting where they've all been when they arrive things are basically too late. They use emails between the club's owners, and notes around the building they left for each other, and security video recordings. And eventually when the guy I mentioned initially recovers they interrogate him a little. (Edit: Edited the proposal to reflect this idea.)</p>
<p>I'm not sure what more I can do, for this thing. I had been thinking of making it that likes to taste human emotion and feelings. Feelings you get when say you're on drugs or are in love when you're having fun or getting it on. The things it can't experience unless it drains those from the people.</p>
