<p>So your narrative is more developed now, but I sorta wonder if this will work as a SCP article.</p>
<p>Logistically how would you go about communicating these events to the reader? Like what addendums? As the Foundation comes in rather last minute, how will they figure out what is going on here?</p>
<p>I think if the Foundation was to come in, see a bunch of dead college kids and they have to put the pieces together, that could be a good arc for the article.</p>
<p>Still not sold on the idea that this is just about a monster that wants to eat people&#8230; there's no motivations, or reason behind it.</p>

							</div>

								
					
